.TH TDX 1 "2026-09-04" "tdx 0.19" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
tdx \- native Linux debugger for DOS EXE/COM (Turbo Debugger X)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B tdx
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
[\fIfile.exe\fR|\fIfile.com\fR]
.P
.B tdx
.BI \-\-bios " BIOS.BIN"
[\fB\-\-floppy\-a\fR \fIA\fR]
[\fB\-\-floppy\-b\fR \fIB\fR]
[\fIOPTIONS\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B tdx
is a DOS 16-bit debugger for Linux.
Unicorn is the default engine for MZ EXE/COM.
.B \-\-bios
runs iron86 with an IBM 5150 8K BIOS (POST, INT 19, FloppyOS).
The CPU window is SDL2.
The guest CGA/MDA screen is
.B tdxview (1)
by default (UNIX sockets, not Xmux).
.P
Always run
.B scripts/tdx\-kill.sh
before starting a new tdx/tdxview pair.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Print usage and exit.
.TP
.BR \-v ", " \-\-version
Print version and exit.
.TP
.BI \-\-floppy\-a " PATH"
Mount
.I PATH
as drive A: (raw 360K/720K image, or a host directory packed as FlopFS).
.TP
.BI \-\-floppy " PATH"
Alias for
.BR \-\-floppy\-a .
.TP
.BI \-\-floppy\-b " PATH"
Drive B: (same rules). Directory pack uses 360K if it fits, else 720K.
.TP
.BI \-\-uc\-floppy " IMAGE"
Boot the same image on Unicorn (not the iron86 BIOS path).
.TP
.BI \-\-bios " FILE"
Load IBM 5150 8K BIOS on iron86 at F000:E000 / reset FFFF:0000.
.TP
.B \-\-mda
MDA 80×25 (B000). Default is CGA (B800).
.TP
.B \-\-no\-ui
Headless (no SDL).
.TP
.B \-\-game
Also open CGA in this process. Default off; use tdxview.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-sock
Do not listen on the agent UNIX socket.
.TP
.BI \-\-sock " PATH"
Agent socket (default
.IR /tmp/tdx.sock ).
.TP
.BI \-\-log\-file " PATH"
Also write logs to
.IR PATH .
.TP
.BI \-\-symbols " PATH"
Load TSV/MAP symbols.
.TP
.B \-\-ghidra
Run Ghidra headless export then load symbols.
.TP
.BI \-\-cwd " PATH"
DOS current directory for INT 21h.
.TP
.B \-\-run
After load, run until break or halt.
.TP
.B \-\-verbose
Log every stepped instruction to stderr.
.TP
.BI \-\-exec\-map " FILE"
Write a 1 MiB executed-opcode map (iron86). Unexecuted bytes stay 0.
.TP
.BI \-\-scale " N"
CPU window integer scale (default 2).
.SH KEYS
CPU window: F7 trace, F8 step over, F9 run/pause, F2 breakpoint,
Ctrl-F2 reset, Alt-X quit.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I /tmp/tdx.sock
Default agent socket.
.TP
.I scripts/tdx-kill.sh
Stop leftover tdx/tdxview and remove sockets.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
Success.
.TP
.B 1
Runtime or load error.
.TP
.B 2
Bad command line.
.SH EXAMPLES
BIOS + FloppyOS A: + game directory as 720K B:
.RS
.B tdx --bios BIOS.BIN --floppy-a floppyos.img --floppy-b games/DRGNWARS
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR tdxview (1),
.BR tdxctl (1),
.BR iron86 (1)
